Webfwlog-0.92 has been released.  Webfwlog is a flexible web-based firewall
log analyzer and supports standard netfilter system logs as well as ULOG
database logs.  New features in this release include the ability to specify
an arbitrary column in the report output for database logs.  For more
information and a demo please visit:

http://www.webfwlog.net

